WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
You are closed. You are not a prophet at all. I am not a human being.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
How do you prove that you are not a human being?

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,550
Don't come here. Don't come here.

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:15,550
I said I'm not a human being

5
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,550
He is lying to you

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,740
Do you understand now?

7
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:29,090
See what idiot

8
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:31,090
If it's just suspicion, you'll kill someone

9
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:33,090
Then everyone will not survive

10
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:38,000
I'm not a prophet

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,350
I'm just here to teach you this truth

12
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:43,350
Don't kill people just because of suspicion

13
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:48,280
You're right. You really can't kill people randomly.

14
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,280
Then you have found the way to be a human being.

15
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:54,980
No matter how we say it, now we can be sure of one thing

16
00:00:54,980 --> 00:01:00,800
This friend is definitely not a human being.

17
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,860
Being a human being only creates chaos and kills people

18
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:06,860
You will definitely not point out the conflict directly like him, right?
